WEBVTT

00:05:01.204 --> 00:05:04.954
Pseudoarcheology
undoubtedly harms its subjects,

00:05:04.996 --> 00:05:08.288
often Indigenous people, like the Maya,

00:05:08.329 --> 00:05:10.954
but it also harms its viewers.

00:05:10.996 --> 00:05:12.913
It harms all of us.

00:05:12.954 --> 00:05:14.704
Like other forms of racism,

00:05:14.746 --> 00:05:16.996
it exacerbates inequality

00:05:17.038 --> 00:05:21.871
and prevents us from appreciating
and benefiting from human diversity.

00:05:23.038 --> 00:05:25.121
What's really scary

00:05:25.163 --> 00:05:31.371
is that pseudoarcheology
is a small part of a much bigger problem.